US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"버럭버럭","en_US":"Violent Tendencies","zh_CN":"暴烈秉性"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"이제 와드 공격으로 W - 버럭버럭의 효과가 발동되지 않습니다. 대신, 와드 공격 시 식물 공격처럼 W - 버럭버럭을 소모하지 않고 공격 속도가 유지됩니다.","en_US":"No longer starts the W sequence when attacking wards. Instead, attacking wards matches plant behavior and maintains the attack speed without consuming W.","zh_CN":"攻擊守衛不再能夠觸發W增傷效果。取而代之的是，攻擊守衛時的行為邏輯比照攻擊植物，不會消耗W，並可維持攻速"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/7/4/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/7/4/0","gameDataKey":"Kled/abilities/E/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"피해량","en_US":"Damage","zh_CN":"傷害"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"이랴!","en_US":"Jousting","zh_CN":"比武"},"before":{"ko_KR":"35/60/85/110/135 (+추가 공격력의 65%)","en_US":"35 / 60 / 85 / 110 / 135 (+ 65% bonus AD)","zh_CN":"35/60/85/110/135（+65%額外物攻）"},"after":{"ko_KR":"35/60/85/110/135 (+추가 공격력의 55%)","en_US":"35 / 60 / 85 / 110 / 135 (+ 55% bonus AD)","zh_CN":"35/60/85/110/135 （+55%額外物攻）"},"impact":"nerf"},{"id":"official/7/4/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/7/4/1","gameDataKey":"Kled/abilities/E/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"이랴!","en_US":"Jousting","zh_CN":"比武"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"이제 E - 이랴!를 재사용할 수 있을 때까지 남은 시간을 알려주는 HUD 추적기가 표시됩니다.","en_US":"Now has a HUD tracker to indicate how long you will have to recast E2","zh_CN":"現在會有E2再次施放所需時間的抬頭顯示器"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/7/4/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/7/4/2","gameDataKey":"Kled/abilities/E/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"이랴!","en_US":"Jousting","zh_CN":"比武"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"이제 E - 이랴!의 재사용이 활성화됐을 때 사거리가 표시됩니다.","en_US":"Now has a range indicator while E2 is active","zh_CN":"E2發動時會有範圍示意特效。"},"impact":"adjus